Tue Sep 29 14:19:04 UTC 2026 - ecsos <ecsos@opensuse.org> - 1.0.1

- Update to 1.0.1
  - This releases only ensures compatibility with Icinga PHP Thirdparty v1.0.1
- Changes from 1.0.0
  - This release raises the required versions of several ipl components and bundles features and fixes from the following releases:
    ipl-html 0.11.0
    ipl-orm 0.9.0
    ipl-scheduler 1.0.0
    ipl-stdlib 0.16.0
    ipl-web 0.14.0
  * Breaking Changes
    - ipl-scheduler upgrades react/promise to version 3.3.0, which drops compatibility with version 2.
  * Highlights
    - ipl-html and ipl-orm include smaller API improvements, including the SelectElement's pleaseChoose option
      and strict ResultSet type declarations.
    - ipl-stdlib adds iterable and string helpers such as Seq::map(), Seq::unique(), and Str::isEmpty().
    - ipl-web adds Content Security Policy handling, form and page widgets, CSS-variable Less compiler support,
      richer search suggestions, and improved CSRF handling via Sec-Fetch-Site.
    - The update also carries fixes for model construction, search UI behavior, long validation messages,
      primary button decoration, and clipboard and search JavaScript behavior.
- Changes from 0.19.3
  - This releases only ensures compatibility with Icinga PHP Thirdparty v0.15.4

